        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9164, Square Mankato Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Mankato Cabinet Knob is available in 3 sizes. This square cabinet knob can be ordered in many of Omnia's modern finishes. The Square Mankato Cabinet Knob is perfect for modern or even transitional kitchen cabinets. It comes packaged with the mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima 9164 Mankato Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Lengths:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>9164/25:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Width: 1\" square</li>\r\n<li.Rose Width: 7/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9164/32:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/4\" square</li>\r\n<li.Rose Width: 1\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9164/38:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li.Rose Width: 1-1/4\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MGR-filigree-detail.jpg?v=1704354535\" width=\"524\" height=\"121\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
